description.narrative:
Khadi and Village Industries Development Program aims at enhancement of income and employment growth in the Khadi and Village Industries (KVI) sector. It supports ADB&apos;s core strategy of inclusive social development, as it will benefit rural poor, especially low-skilled workers, disadvantaged and women. The Program aims  at: 
(i) establishing a policy reform and implementation framework; 
(ii) promoting and marketing khadi; 
(iii) realizing procurement and production efficiencies; and 
(iv) implementing institutional reforms.
